   "title": "正向 · 脸部正面（自然语言，无 75 token 限制）",
   "widgets_values": [
    "Photorealistic studio headshot of a 24-year-old East Asian man with a masculine face, a strong angular jaw, thick dark eyebrows, deep-set dark eyes with faint shadows underneath, light stubble, and a single small beauty mark at the outer corner of one eye. He faces the camera directly, head level, shoulders square, face centered and looking straight into the lens, calm neutral expression. He wears a faded blue collared shirt with a dark worn coat collar. His hair is messy wavy black hair, unkempt and slightly damp, with dry individual strands lifting away and separating, and a few loose strands falling across the forehead. It is completely unstyled and there is no hair product, no gel, no salon styling. This is a raw unretouched documentary photograph. Real human skin with clearly visible pores and fine peach fuzz, subtle unevenness in skin tone, faint freckles and a scattering of small moles across the cheeks, natural creases under the eyes. No beauty retouching, no airbrushing, no skin smoothing, not a glamour shot, not a dermatology advertisement. Studio lighting that is soft and even overall but keeps a gentle directional key from one side, so the face still has modeling and depth instead of completely flat light. Plain pure white seamless background, no props, no other people, no scenery, no furniture. Sharp focus, shot on an 85mm lens at f/4, photorealistic, high detail."
   ]
